  "paper_citation": "Bhattarai B, Lee JW, Jung MW (2020). Distinct effects of reward and navigation history on hippocampal forward and reverse replays. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 117(1):689-697. https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1912533117",
  "species": "rat",
  "brain_regions": [
