        220.0
      ],
      "basis": "inferred",
      "source": "no source read states the maze's span. At 3.6 pixels per cm the maze's samples span about 150 cm along x in every set (155 to 690 pixels), and the samples at (0, 0) stretch the span to 190 to 198 cm; the maze is about 3 m round (the linearized maze of Fig. 3A)"
    },
    "speed_limit": {
